#: utils/formatting.cpp:1817
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The signing certificate has expired."
msgstr "El certificat de signatura ha vençut."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1823
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The signing certificate has been revoked."
msgstr "El certificat de signatura s'ha revocat."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1846
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The signing certificate is not present in your certificate list, but it is "
"needed to verify the data."
msgstr ""
"El certificat de signatura no està present a la vostra llista de "
"certificats, però cal per a verificar les dades."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1851
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Technically, signature and data match, but the signing certificate is not "
"marked as trusted. Therefore the data cannot be trusted to originate from "
"the stated source."
msgstr ""
"Tècnicament, la signatura i les dades coincideixen, però el certificat de "
"signatura no està marcat com a fiable. Per tant, no es pot confiar que les "
"dades s'originin des de la font indicada."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1857
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"For an expired certificate, it cannot be evaluated whether the certificate "
"can be trusted. Therefore the data cannot be trusted. Technically, signature "
"and data match."
msgstr ""
"Per a un certificat caducat, no es pot avaluar si es pot confiar en el "
"certificat. Per tant, no es poden confiar en les dades. Tècnicament, la "
"signatura i les dades coincideixen."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1859
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If the certificate was valid and trusted when you received the data, the "
"data is likely valid."
msgstr ""
"Si el certificat era vàlid i de confiança quan vau rebre les dades, és "
"probable que les dades siguin vàlides."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1862
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The certificate may have been revoked because it was compromised and it "
"might now be used by a third party. The data can therefore not be trusted. "
"Technically, signature and data match."
msgstr ""
"El certificat pot haver estat revocat perquè estava compromès i ara podria "
"utilitzar-se per un tercer. Per tant, no es pot confiar en les dades. "
"Tècnicament, la signatura i les dades coincideixen."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1865
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"It is possible that you received the data at a time when the certificate was "
"still valid and trusted. If this is the case, the data may be valid."
msgstr ""
"És possible que hàgiu rebut les dades en un moment en què el certificat "
"continuava sent vàlid i de confiança. En aquest cas, les dades podrien ser "
"vàlides."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1871
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The data or the signature has been altered. This can happen accidentally (e."
"g. due to a transmission error), unintentionally (e.g. due to a subsequent "
"change to the data, possibly by an email client), or intentionally "
"(deliberate manipulation)."
msgstr ""
"Les dades o la signatura s'han alterat. Això pot succeir accidentalment (per "
"exemple, a causa d'un error de transmissió), involuntàriament (per exemple, "
"a causa d'un canvi posterior a les dades, possiblement per un client de "
"correu electrònic) o intencionadament (manipulació deliberada)."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1888
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Ask the sender for the certificate or import it from a file or a keyserver. "
"Then verify the data again."
msgstr ""
"Demaneu al remitent el certificat o importeu-lo des d'un fitxer o un "
"servidor de claus. Després verifiqueu les dades de nou."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1893
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Verify the certificate’s fingerprint and certify it. Then verify the data "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Verifiqueu l'empremta digital del certificat i certifiqueu-la. Després "
"verifiqueu les dades de nou."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1894
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Verify the certificate’s Root-CA fingerprint and trust it. Then verify the "
"data again."
msgstr ""
"Verifiqueu l'empremta digital de la Root-CA del certificat i confieu-hi. "
"Després verifiqueu les dades de nou."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1900
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"You can look for an updated certificate on a keyserver, or ask the sender "
"for it, then verify the data again after importing the certificate."
msgstr ""
"Podeu cercar un certificat actualitzat en un servidor de claus, o demanar-lo "
"al remitent, i seguidament verificar les dades de nou després d'importar el "
"certificat."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1904 utils/formatting.cpp:1908
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If in doubt, contact the signer to clarify the situation and, if necessary, "
"ask them to resend the data signed with a current certificate."
msgstr ""
"En cas de dubte, poseu-vos en contacte amb el signant per aclarir la "
"situació i, si cal, demanar-li que torni a enviar les dades signades amb un "
"certificat actual."

#: utils/formatting.cpp:1912
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Ask the sender to resend the data."
msgstr "Demaneu al remitent que reenviï les dades."

#: utils/gnupg.cpp:437
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "GnuPG provides support for OpenPGP/LibrePGP and S/MIME."
msgstr "GnuPG proporciona la implementació de l'OpenPGP/LibrePGP i S/MIME."

#: utils/gnupg.cpp:446
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Libgcrypt is a general purpose cryptographic library."
msgstr "Libgcrypt és una biblioteca criptogràfica de caràcter general."

#: utils/hex.cpp:33
#, kde-format
msgid "Invalid hex char '%1' in input stream."
msgstr "Caràcter hexadecimal «%1» no vàlid en el flux d'entrada."

#: utils/hex.cpp:45 utils/hex.cpp:50
#, kde-format
msgid "Premature end of hex-encoded char in input stream"
msgstr "Final prematur del caràcter codificat hexadecimal en el flux d'entrada"

